5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a system that prevents friction. Current arrangements are failing.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I worry about fairness. Do the spots match where people actually park?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The morning rush is chaotic. Position determines damage. I need data.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Everyone asks about costs. Nobody checks the ledger. I will.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am concerned about the long-term maintenance burden. Who does the work?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, if the ledger shows neglect, we need strict rules.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
