14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the minutes and the sticker register.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,We must avoid a system that creates hidden resentment.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
