35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The logs show complaints die out because no one is responsible.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,I saw people shifting bikes just to leave. It is inefficient.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I watched the exits. Four times, someone blocked another.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The ledger shows no capital funds. A new frame costs money.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The minutes show the same flats held the covered spots for five years.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, that is a problem. We need a rotation or a clear rule.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, the rain is bad too. The dry spots are too few.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,The dry spots are under the eaves. The rest get wet.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"If we buy a frame, who pays? The ledger is empty.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,The sticker register shows some flats have three bikes. They ride daily.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,We cannot just let the same people keep the good spots.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,I think we should prioritize those who ride daily.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"If the daily riders get the dry spots, the morning rush eases.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"That is fair, but it costs. The ledger has no money for it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The daily riders said they would pay. That solves the cost.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I agree. A rule based on usage is logical and fair.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"Yes, it helps everyone. I support prioritizing daily riders.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,It reduces the shoving. I support it.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"If they pay, the ledger stays balanced. I support it.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,It is sustainable. The work is defined. I support it.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
